---
system: sys-06-content-and-personalization
flow_id: entitlement-grant-mobile
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/06-content-and-personalization#post-v1contententitlements
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, ContentService, BillingService, PostgreSQL, Redis]
apis:
  - POST /v1/content/entitlements
externals: [Redis]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - parent_jwt_stale_re_pin_required
  - content_pack_not_found
  - already_entitled
  - subscription_required_not_active
  - parent_approval_required_pending
idempotency: X-Request-Id 24h dedup; idempotent on (user_id, content_pack_id) — returns existing row if already granted
retry: caller-side exponential backoff on 5xx only
timeout: 3s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant ContentService
    participant BillingService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis

    Note over ParentApp: parent in cl_add_free confirms course unlock (ADR-0005 D7 — replaces hardcoded 7351)
    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/content/entitlements {user_id, content_pack_id, X-Request-Id} and parent JWT Bearer
    Gateway->>Gateway: auth-resolver — JWT audience: tbot:parent (sys-17)
    alt parent_jwt_stale_re_pin_required
        Note over Gateway: parent JWT issued > 60s ago (ADR-0005 D6)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401 parent_jwt_stale — re-PIN required
    else authenticated
        Gateway->>ContentService: forward request
        ContentService->>ContentService: verify parent JWT freshness < 60s (ADR-0005 D6)
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT content_packs WHERE id=?
        alt content_pack_not_found
            PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: no rows
            ContentService-->>Gateway: 404 content_pack_not_found
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 404
        else pack found
            PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: content_pack row
            ContentService->>BillingService: GET /internal/v1/entitlements/:householdId (service-token — see entitlement-check-session-start.sequence.mmd)
            BillingService-->>ContentService: {tier, features, subscriptionActive}
            alt subscription_required_not_active
                Note over ContentService: content_pack requires subscription tier, billing reports inactive
                ContentService-->>Gateway: 402 subscription_required_not_active
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 402
            else parent_approval_required_pending
                Note over ContentService: content_pack requires explicit parent_approvals entry, none found
                ContentService-->>Gateway: 403 parent_approval_required_pending
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
            else already_entitled
                ContentService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT content_entitlements WHERE user_id=? AND content_pack_id=?
                PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: existing row (revoked_at IS NULL)
                Note over ContentService: idempotent — return existing entitlement
                ContentService-->>Gateway: 200 {entitlement_id, granted_at, source: 'existing'}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
            else success
                ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT content_entitlements {user_id, content_pack_id, granted_at, x_request_id} ON CONFLICT (user_id, content_pack_id) DO NOTHING RETURNING *
                PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: entitlement row
                ContentService->>Redis: DEL entitlements:{householdId} (invalidate cached entitlement)
                Redis-->>ContentService: OK
                ContentService-->>Gateway: 200 {entitlement_id, granted_at}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp: cl_add_free → cl_added screen transition
    Note over ParentApp,Redis: future session-start uses cached entitlement per entitlement-check-session-start.sequence.mmd — cache invalidated above so next read is fresh
    Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: timeout 3s p99 — X-Request-Id 24h dedup — idempotent on (user_id, content_pack_id)
